{"seq":2,"slug":"founding-the-empire","title":"帝国奠基","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/otto-von-bismarck/major-events/founding-the-empire","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-proclamation-at-versailles","title":"凡尔赛宫的加冕","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/otto-von-bismarck/major-events/founding-the-empire/the-proclamation-at-versailles","wordCount":1880,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"building-the-german-state","title":"建设德意志国家","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/otto-von-bismarck/major-events/founding-the-empire/building-the-german-state","wordCount":1812,"readingTime":8}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"帝国奠基\">帝国奠基</h1><p>德意志帝国的诞生与建设，是俾斯麦功业的顶点。本章考察这一奠基历程。</p>\n<p>第一篇文档讲述&quot;凡尔赛宫的加冕&quot;——帝国在宿敌王宫宣告成立的象征性时刻。第二篇文档讲述&quot;建设德意志国家&quot;,呈现他把帝国建设为统一高效现代国家的努力。</p>\n"}